  "question": "다음 데이터에 대한 윈도우 함수 결과로 옳은 것은?\n\nsal = (100, 200, 200, 300, 400)",
  "codeBlock": "SELECT sal,\n  RANK()       OVER (ORDER BY sal) AS r,\n  DENSE_RANK() OVER (ORDER BY sal) AS dr,\n  ROW_NUMBER() OVER (ORDER BY sal) AS rn\nFROM t;",
